ges\u002F2.laravel\u002F7.migrating-to-vatly",{"title":187,"path":188,"stem":189},"Configuration","\u002Fpackages\u002Flaravel\u002Fconfiguration","3.packages\u002F2.laravel\u002F99.configuration",{"title":191,"path":192,"stem":193},"Integrations","\u002Fintegrations","4.integrations",{"id":195,"title":50,"body":196,"description":1654,"extension":1655,"links":1656,"meta":1657,"navigation":1658,"path":51,"seo":1659,"stem":52,"__hash__":1660},"docs\u002F1.guides\u002F9.testing.md",{"type":197,"value":198,"toc":1641},"minimark",[199,204,218,222,245,250,269,273,295,310,314,317,348,352,357,397,404,507,511,514,608,611,767,771,785,1555,1559,1571,1576,1629,1637],[200,201,203],"h2",{"id":202},"overview","Overview",[205,206,207,208,212,213,217],"p",{},"Vatly provides test helper endpoints that let you simulate billing events without waiting for real billing cycles. These endpoints are only available in ",[209,210,211],"strong",{},"test mode"," and require a ",[214,215,216],"code",{},"test_"," prefixed API token.",[200,219,221],{"id":220},"taxes-in-test-mode","Taxes in test mode",[223,224,225,226,229,230,232,233,236,237,240,241,244],"warning",{},"In test mode, Vatly does ",[209,227,228],{},"not"," run real tax determination. Checkouts and orders created with a ",[214,231,216],{}," token use a ",[209,234,235],{},"fixed, predefined set of tax rates"," so results are predictable while you build your integration. ",[209,238,239],{},"These rates are simulated for testing only — they are not guaranteed to match real, current statutory rates, and must never be relied upon for pricing decisions, accounting, invoicing, or tax compliance."," Switch to a ",[214,242,243],{},"live_"," token to get Vatly's real, jurisdiction-accurate tax determination.",[246,247,249],"h3",{"id":248},"how-test-mode-rates-are-applied","How test-mode rates are applied",[205,251,252,253,256,257,260,261,264,265,268],{},"The buyer's country determines a single fixed ",[209,254,255],{},"standard"," VAT rate from a built-in lookup. Any country without a specific entry is taxed at a flat ",[209,258,259],{},"20%",". As an example of multi-rate handling, a Canada (",[214,262,263],{},"CA",") buyer also gets an additional 9.975% ",[214,266,267],{},"QST"," line. Only the standard rate is ever applied — there are no reduced or product-specific rates, and the lookup is not kept in sync with statutory changes.",[246,270,272],{"id":271},"tax-ids-and-reverse-charge-in-test-mode","Tax IDs and reverse charge in test mode",[205,274,275,276,278,279,282,283,286,287,290,291,294],{},"Tax IDs are ",[209,277,228],{}," checked against VIES or any real registry in test mode. A test tax ID is treated as ",[209,280,281],{},"valid only when it starts with the buyer's uppercase country code"," — for example ",[214,284,285],{},"DE123456789"," is valid for a German buyer, while ",[214,288,289],{},"de123456789"," or ",[214,292,293],{},"FR123…"," for a German buyer is not.",[205,296,297,298,301,302,305,306,309],{},"When a ",[209,299,300],{},"valid"," test tax ID is supplied and the buyer's country ",[209,303,304],{},"differs"," from the seller's, a ",[209,307,308],{},"0% reverse charge"," is applied (B2B cross-border). Otherwise the buyer's country standard rate applies.",[200,311,313],{"id":312},"fast-forward-subscription-renewal","Fast-forward subscription renewal",[205,315,316],{},"Simulates a subscription renewal cycle, allowing you to test renewal billing flows, lifecycle events, and webhooks without waiting for the actual billing interval. The subscription must be active and have a scheduled next renewal.",[205,318,319,320,323,324,327,328,331,332,335,336,339,340,343,344,347],{},"Like a live renewal, this runs ",[209,321,322],{},"asynchronously",": the request is accepted immediately, the renewal runs from a queue a moment later, and the outcome arrives on your ",[214,325,326],{},"order.paid"," \u002F ",[214,329,330],{},"order.payment_failed"," webhooks. The response therefore returns the subscription ",[209,333,334],{},"before"," the renewal — ",[214,337,338],{},"renewedAt",", ",[214,341,342],{},"renewedUntil",", and ",[214,345,346],{},"nextRenewalAt"," have not moved yet.",[246,349,351],{"id":350},"request","Request",[205,353,354],{},[214,355,356],{},"POST \u002Fv1\u002Ftest-helpers\u002Fsubscriptions\u002F{subscriptionId}\u002Ffast-forward-renewal",[358,359,360,376],"table",{},[361,362,363],"thead",{},[364,365,366,370,373],"tr",{},[367,368,369],"th",{},"Parameter",[367,371,372],{},"Type",[367,374,375],{},"Description",[377,378,379],"tbody",{},[364,380,381,387,390],{},[382,383,384],"td",{},[214,385,386],{},"subscriptionId",[382,388,389],{},"string",[382,391,392,393,396],{},"ID of the subscription to renew (starts with ",[214,394,395],{},"subscription_",")",[205,398,399,400,403],{},"The request body is ",[209,401,402],{},"optional",". Omit it to advance the billing cycle and leave the renewal payment pending — the endpoint's original behaviour. Provide it to force a specific renewal payment outcome so you can exercise your payment-recovery handling.",[358,405,406,417],{},[361,407,408],{},[364,409,410,413,415],{},[367,411,412],{},"Field",[367,414,372],{},[367,416,375],{},[377,418,419,447],{},[364,420,421,426,428],{},[382,422,423],{},[214,424,425],{},"paymentStatus",[382,427,389],{},[382,429,430,431,290,434,437,438,440,441,443,444,446],{},"Optional. Outcome to force on the renewal payment: ",[214,432,433],{},"paid",[214,435,436],{},"failed",". Omit to leave the payment pending. ",[214,439,436],{}," declines the payment and starts a payment recovery (delivering ",[214,442,330],{}," to your webhook); ",[214,445,433],{}," settles it.",[364,448,449,454,456],{},[382,450,451],{},[214,452,453],{},"failureReason",[382,455,389],{},[382,457,458,459,462,463,339,466,339,469,472,473,475,476,339,478,339,480,339,482,339,485,339,488,339,491,339,494,339,497,339,500,339,503,506],{},"Optional. Which decline to simulate, valid only with ",[214,460,461],{},"paymentStatus: failed",". Soft declines (",[214,464,465],{},"insufficient_funds",[214,467,468],{},"temporary_decline",[214,470,471],{},"general_failure",") retry over multiple weeks; every other value is a hard decline that asks the customer for a new payment method. Defaults to ",[214,474,471],{},". Allowed values: ",[214,477,465],{},[214,479,468],{},[214,481,471],{},[214,483,484],{},"invalid_mandate",[214,486,487],{},"mandate_canceled",[214,489,490],{},"account_closed",[214,492,493],{},"card_expired",[214,495,496],{},"card_lost_or_stolen",[214,498,499],{},"invalid_card_details",[214,501,502],{},"authentication_failed",[214,504,505],{},"fraud_suspected",".",[246,508,510],{"id":509},"example","Example",[205,512,513],{},"Advance the cycle and leave the renewal payment pending:",[515,516,518,566],"code-group",{"sync":517},"client",[519,520,525],"pre",{"className":521,"code":522,"filename":523,"language":524,"meta":113,"style":113},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","curl -X POST https:\u002F\u002Fapi.vatly.com\u002Fv1\u002Ftest-helpers\u002Fsubscriptions\u002Fsubscription_Lp3mNvBxKw7RjTgYcZaE\u002Ffast-forward-renewal \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer test_your_api_key_here\"\n","cURL","bash",[214,526,527,550],{"__ignoreMap":113},[528,529,532,536,540,543,546],"span",{"class":530,"line":531},"line",1,[528,533,535],{"class":534},"sBMFI","curl",[528,537,539],{"class":538},"sfazB"," -X",[528,541,542],{"class":538}," POST",[528,544,545],{"class":538}," https:\u002F\u002Fapi.vatly.com\u002Fv1\u002Ftest-helpers\u002Fsubscriptions\u002Fsubscription_Lp3mNvBxKw7RjTgYcZaE\u002Ffast-forward-renewal",[528,547,549],{"class":548},"sTEyZ"," \\\n",[528,551,553,556,560,563],{"class":530,"line":552},2,[528,554,555],{"class":538},"  -H",[528,557,559],{"class":558},"sMK4o"," \"",[528,561,562],{"class":538},"Authorization: Bearer test_your_api_key_here",[528,564,565],{"class":558},"\"\n",[519,567,572],{"className":568,"code":569,"filename":570,"language":571,"meta":113,"style":113},"language-php shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","$vatly->testHelpers->fastForwardRenewal('subscription_Lp3mNvBxKw7RjTgYcZaE');\n","PHP","php",[214,573,574],{"__ignoreMap":113},[528,575,576,579,582,585,588,590,594,597,600,603,605],{"class":530,"line":531},[528,577,578],{"class":558},"$",[528,580,581],{"class":548},"vatly",[528,583,584],{"class":558},"->",[528,586,587],{"class":548},"testHelpers",[528,589,584],{"class":558},[528,591,593],{"class":592},"s2Zo4","fastForwardRenewal",[528,595,596],{"class":558},"(",[528,598,599],{"class":558},"'",[528,601,602],{"class":538},"subscription_Lp3mNvBxKw7RjTgYcZaE",[528,604,599],{"class":558},[528,606,607],{"class":558},");\n",[205,609,610],{},"Force the renewal payment to fail with a hard decline to test payment recovery:",[515,612,613,690],{"sync":517},[519,614,616],{"className":521,"code":615,"filename":523,"language":524,"meta":113,"style":113},"curl -X POST https:\u002F\u002Fapi.vatly.com\u002Fv1\u002Ftest-helpers\u002Fsubscriptions\u002Fsubscription_Lp3mNvBxKw7RjTgYcZaE\u002Ffast-forward-renewal \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer test_your_api_key_here\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application\u002Fjson\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"paymentStatus\": \"failed\",\n    \"failureReason\": \"card_expired\"\n  }'\n",[214,617,618,630,643,657,669,675,681],{"__ignoreMap":113},[528,619,620,622,624,626,628],{"class":530,"line":531},[528,621,535],{"class":534},[528,623,539],{"class":538},[528,625,542],{"class":538},[528,627,545],{"class":538},[528,629,549],{"class":548},[528,631,632,634,636,638,641],{"class":530,"line":552},[528,633,555],{"class":538},[528,635,559],{"class":558},[528,637,562],{"class":538},[528,639,640],{"class":558},"\"",[528,642,549],{"class":548},[528,644,646,648,650,653,655],{"class":530,"line":645},3,[528,647,555],{"class":538},[528,649,559],{"class":558},[528,651,652],{"class":538},"Content-Type: application\u002Fjson",[528,654,640],{"class":558},